<section class="scope-statement">
  <h2>Scope of practice</h2>
  <p>
    Shin Wellness is informed by Saebyuk's professional education in psychotherapy and play therapy.
    Unless explicitly described otherwise, Shin Wellness gatherings and digital practices are offered
    as wellness, educational, reflective, and community experiences rather than psychotherapy or
    mental-health treatment.
  </p>
  <p>
    Participation in Shin Wellness is not a substitute for medical care, diagnosis, psychotherapy,
    crisis support, or treatment from an appropriate licensed professional.
  </p>
</section>
